				<div class="experience-item">
					<div class="experience-header">
						<h3 class="experience-title">XR Master Thesis - R&D Graphics Programmer</h3>
						<span class="experience-date">03/2026 - Present</span>
					</div>
					<div class="experience-company-location">
						<span class="experience-company">Lemons in the Room</span>
						<span class="experience-location">Firenze, Italy</span>
					</div>
					<ul class="experience-desc">
						<li>Built a real-time Mixed Reality pipeline for Meta Quest 3 capable of converting Depth Maps into continuous geometry via Compute and Mesh Shaders.</li>
						<li>Engineered a 'context-aware' system performing GPU-based topological analysis fused with semantic data to generate procedural PBR materials.</li>
