						<li>Developed custom HLSL Shaders and post-processing pipelines to establish the game's unique visual identity.</li>
					</ul>
				</div>
				
				<div class="experience-item">
					<div class="experience-header">
						<h3 class="experience-title">Teaching Assistant (GUI)</h3>
						<span class="experience-date">10/2024 - 01/2025</span>
					</div>
					<div class="experience-company-location">
						<span class="experience-company">Politecnico di Torino</span>
						<span class="experience-location">Torino, Italy</span>
					</div>
					<ul class="experience-desc">
						<li>Tutored students in UI/UX principles and frontend programming during weekly laboratory sessions.</li>
						<li>Wrote technical documentation and created high-quality instructional content to improve comprehension.</li>
					</ul>
				</div>

				<div class="experience-item">
					<div class="experience-header">
						<h3 class="experience-title">Video Artist</h3>
						<span class="experience-date">09/2023 - 06/2024</span>
					</div>
					<div class="experience-company-location">
						<span class="experience-company">RKH SRL</span>
						<span class="experience-location">Torino, Italy</span>
					</div>
					<ul class="experience-desc">
						<li>Operated professional cameras (RED, Blackmagic 4K/6K) and assisted DOP with complex lighting setups.</li>
						<li>Handled editing and post-production workflows using DaVinci Resolve for corporate content.</li>
